{"id":71326,"date":"2026-10-29T19:25:10","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:25:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71326"},"modified":"2026-10-29T20:26:43","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:26:43","slug":"trail-rota-da-telha","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-rota-da-telha\/","title":{"rendered":"3\u00ba Trail Rota da Telha 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">3\u00ba Trail Rota da Telha 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>3\u00ba Trail Rota da Telha 2027<\/strong> (III TRT) realiza-se no dia <strong>17 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (Domingo), tendo como centro nevr\u00e1lgico a aldeia das <strong>Lajes<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Seia<\/strong>, distrito da <strong>Guarda<\/strong>. Situada na encosta beir\u00e3 entre a margem direita do rio Seia e a margem esquerda do rio Mondego, a prova percorre trilhos rurais e de montanha com vistas privilegiadas para a Serra da Estrela.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo integra tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias com meta comum no <strong>Campo de Futebol do GDCR Lajes<\/strong>: o <strong>Trail Longo de 28 km (950 m D+)<\/strong>, com partida \u00e0s <strong>08:45<\/strong> junto ao Santu\u00e1rio de Santa Euf\u00e9mia em Paranhos da Beira (transporte assegurado pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0s 08:00 desde a sede do GDCRL); o <strong>Trail Curto de 18 km (750 m D+)<\/strong>, com partida \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> junto ao Sal\u00e3o Paroquial de Tazem (transporte \u00e0s 08:45); e a <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong>, que arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> na sede do GDCRL. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui par de manguitos alusivo ao evento (no trail), medalha de <em>finisher<\/em>, abastecimentos, banhos e almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio para todos os participantes.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong>Grupo Desportivo Cultural e Recreativo das Lajes (GDCRL)<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong>Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Tourais e Lajes<\/strong> e da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Seia<\/strong>, o evento est\u00e1 limitado a <strong>500 atletas<\/strong> e atribui trof\u00e9us aos tr\u00eas primeiros da geral M\/F, medalhas por escal\u00e3o, pr\u00e9mios \u00e0s tr\u00eas equipas mais numerosas e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios \u00e0s tr\u00eas melhores equipas (150 \u20ac, 100 \u20ac e 50 \u20ac, apurados pelos 4 melhores atletas). Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">17 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Sede e Campo de Futebol do GDCR Lajes, Lajes, Seia, Guarda<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; lett